  "_comment": "World objects (2026-10-07): everything that stands on a cell and is removed by a tool or picked up — trees, stumps, rocks, scrap heaps, weeds, branches, junk, forage. Loaded by scripts/world_object_db.gd, instanced per zone by scripts/world_objects.gd. Fields: name; tool (axe/pickaxe/scythe/hoe or 'any' = any tool or weapon; 'hand' = picked up with the interact button); hp (hits at tier-1 damage 1; better tools hit harder: damage = tier); min_tier (tool tier needed to make a dent); size [w,h] footprint in cells (top-left anchored); solid (blocks movement); sprite (res path; '{season}' is replaced by the current season, '{v}' by the instance's variant number); variants (count of {v} variants, default 1); drops: list of {item, min, max, chance (default 1)}; becomes (kind left behind when destroyed, e.g. a tree leaves a stump); xp {skill: amount}; sound_hit / sound_break (AudioManager SFX names); fall (tree topple animation); forage_item (for tool 'hand': the item picked up); spawn_on (daily respawn layer: 'debris' or 'forage_<season>').",

